# 📖 Quranic Management System

A modern web-based **Quranic Management System** designed to help Quranic schools (Madrasas) efficiently manage students, teachers, classes, attendance, exams, fees, and administrative activities from a single platform.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

The Quranic Management System is a full-stack web application built to digitize the daily operations of Quranic schools. It provides administrators and teachers with an easy-to-use interface for managing academic and financial records while improving efficiency and reducing paperwork.

---

## ✨ Features

### 👤 Authentication
- Secure Login
- JWT Authentication
- Role-Based Access Control
- Protected Routes

### 👨‍🎓 Student Management
- Register Students
- Update Student Information
- Delete Students
- Search Students
- Student Profiles
- Parent Contact Information
- Class Assignment

### 👨‍🏫 Teacher Management
- Add Teachers
- Update Teacher Details
- Teacher Profiles
- Assign Teachers to Classes

### 🏫 Class Management
- Create Classes
- Assign Students
- Assign Teachers
- Manage Class Information

### 📚 Subject Management
- Create Subjects
- Assign Subjects to Classes
- View Subject Lists

### ✅ Attendance Management
- Record Daily Attendance
- View Attendance History
- Track Student Attendance

### 📝 Examination Management
- Create Exams
- Record Student Marks
- View Exam Results
- Academic Year Management

### 💰 Finance Management
- Student Fee Management
- Income Tracking
- Expense Tracking
- Financial Reports

### 💵 Salary Management
- Teacher Salary Records
- Salary Payments
- Payment History

### 🏥 Health Records
- Store Student Health Information
- Medical Notes
- Emergency Information

### 📋 Discipline Reports
- Record Student Behaviour
- Manage Discipline Cases

### 📊 Dashboard
- Student Statistics
- Teacher Statistics
- Financial Summary
- Attendance Overview

---

# 🛠️ Tech Stack

## Frontend

- React.js
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Zustand
- Axios
- React Router DOM
- React Icons
- Framer Motion
- Recharts

## Backend

- Node.js
- Express.js
- PostgreSQL
- Prisma ORM
- JWT Authentication
- bcrypt
- Cookie Parser
- CORS
- Dotenv

