# 🚀 Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/quranic-management-system.git
```

## Navigate to Project

```bash
cd quranic-management-system
```

---

## Install Backend Dependencies

```bash
cd server
npm install
```

---

## Install Frontend Dependencies

```bash
cd ../client
npm install
```

---

# ⚙️ Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file inside the server folder.

```env
PORT=5000

DATABASE_URL=your_database_url

JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key

NODE_ENV=development
```

---

# 🗄️ Database

Generate Prisma Client

```bash
npx prisma generate
```

Run Migrations

```bash
npx prisma migrate dev
```

Open Prisma Studio

```bash
npx prisma studio
```

---

# ▶️ Run the Application

Backend

```bash
npm run dev
```

Frontend

```bash
npm run dev
```

